# Only worker/Dockerfile builds from this repo, with its context set to the repo root (see
# worker/README.md for why) -- this keeps that build fast by excluding everything the Dockerfile
# doesn't explicitly COPY. Only the paths the Dockerfile actually needs (worker/, lib/marketplaces,
# lib/storage) are relevant; everything else here is just noise the daemon would otherwise hash.
node_modules
worker/node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel
*.log
.env
.env.local
coverage
